WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.062 --> 00:00:05.734
"Poor Bot!" Ringo sighed.

2
00:00:05.735 --> 00:00:08.960
He looked at his broken robot.

3
00:00:08.961 --> 00:00:13.888
Ringo made fists. "I must fix her!"

4
00:00:13.889 --> 00:00:19.428
He looked on his computer.

5
00:00:19.429 --> 00:00:27.374
"Maybe someone still sells hex links."

6
00:00:27.375 --> 00:00:32.555
Ringo found a repair shop on Rusty Moon.

7
00:00:32.556 --> 00:00:44.898
He gasped. "They sell old hex links!"

8
00:00:44.899 --> 00:00:47.422
Ringo grabbed Bot.

9
00:00:47.423 --> 00:00:50.848
"I'll fly to Rusty Moon now!" he said.

10
00:00:50.849 --> 00:00:55.058
Just then Captain Nova's voice came over a speaker.

11
00:00:55.059 --> 00:01:12.310
"All rookies, report to my office!"

12
00:01:12.311 --> 00:01:15.796
"I have big news," Captain Nova said.

13
00:01:15.797 --> 00:01:19.440
"Commander Cosmo wants to have an inspection.

14
00:01:19.441 --> 00:01:23.123
Every robot and spaceship must look perfect.

15
00:01:23.124 --> 00:01:26.400
He wants everyone to look snappy!"

16
00:01:26.401 --> 00:01:29.968
Ringo frowned. "Snappy?"

17
00:01:29.969 --> 00:01:33.329
Captain Nova rolled her eyes.

18
00:01:33.330 --> 00:01:37.706
"You must look perfect, Ringo!"

19
00:01:37.707 --> 00:01:40.667
"No problem!" Lucy said.

20
00:01:40.668 --> 00:01:43.582
"I'll clean up the spaceships."

21
00:01:43.583 --> 00:01:46.636
Lucy ran off.

22
00:01:46.637 --> 00:01:50.423
"Um, Captain Nova," Ringo said.

23
00:01:50.424 --> 00:01:54.249
"Can I fly to Rusty Moon first?

24
00:01:54.250 --> 00:01:58.025
Bot needs a new part."

25
00:01:58.026 --> 00:02:01.492
"You don't have time," Captain Nova said.

26
00:02:01.493 --> 00:02:05.613
Ringo got upset. "But Bot—"

27
00:02:05.614 --> 00:02:09.527
"Bot is old and clunky," Captain Nova said.

28
00:02:09.528 --> 00:02:16.792
"You need a new robot."

